sequenceDiagram
    box Aqua Front end
        actor Alice
        participant App as Mobile app
    end
    box rgb(255, 235, 210) Back end
        participant GW as Gateway
        participant Svc as Profile service
    end
    Alice->>App: Open profile
    App->>GW: GET /me
    GW->>Svc: Load profile
    rect rgb(225, 240, 255)
        Svc->>Svc: Merge cached fields
        Svc-->>GW: Profile JSON
    end
    GW-->>App: 200 OK
    App-->>Alice: Render profile
    Alice<<->>App: Pull to refresh
